  <dda.quest.bulkhead.title>Bulkhead repairs</dda.quest.bulkhead.title>
  <dda.quest.bulkhead.desc>The pump room bulkhead is leaking again. Bring steel to the chief and select Hand In on the material objective. You can deliver it in batches. Once all three pieces are in, select Turn in to claim your reward.</dda.quest.bulkhead.desc>
  <dda.quest.bulkhead.quote>“Stop the leak first. The forms can wait.”</dda.quest.bulkhead.quote>
  <dda.quest.bulkhead.obj.plates>Supply steel for the patch</dda.quest.bulkhead.obj.plates>
  <dda.quest.soundings.title>City sounding report</dda.quest.soundings.title>
  <dda.quest.soundings.desc>Enter a city port on a later leg. Its arrival stamp goes into the ship’s log, so you can file the report by radio.</dda.quest.soundings.desc>
  <dda.quest.soundings.obj.port>Enter a city port</dda.quest.soundings.obj.port>
  <dda.quest.soundings.location>Any city port</dda.quest.soundings.location>
  <dda.quest.samples.title>Mineral samples</dda.quest.samples.title>
  <dda.quest.samples.desc>The merchant needs two intact saltpeter samples for the stock ledger. Deliver them at an outpost shop. Further consignments are welcome.</dda.quest.samples.desc>
  <dda.quest.samples.obj.ore>Deliver saltpeter mineral samples</dda.quest.samples.obj.ore>
  <dda.quest.watch.title>Crawler watch</dda.quest.watch.title>
  <dda.quest.watch.desc>A pack is closing on the shipping lane. Have the crew take down three crawlers, then claim the bounty by radio.</dda.quest.watch.desc>
  <dda.quest.watch.quote>“Three fewer blips on sonar and I’ll sign.”</dda.quest.watch.quote>
  <dda.quest.watch.obj.crawlers>Defeat crawlers with your crew</dda.quest.watch.obj.crawlers>
